  <p id="c-nanshi-013-wangzhenfeng-liuhuang:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-013-wangzhenfeng-liuhuang:p001:m0000" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABA">義融</persName>位五兵尚書，領軍，有質幹，善於用短。卒諡恭侯。子孝侯<persName id="c-nanshi-013-wangzhenfeng-liuhuang:p001:m0028" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABAA">覬</persName>嗣，無子，弟<persName id="c-nanshi-013-wangzhenfeng-liuhuang:p001:m0035" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABAB">襲</persName>以子<persName id="c-nanshi-013-wangzhenfeng-liuhuang:p001:m0038" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABABA">晃</persName>繼。</p>
</text>
